    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 500,
      "text": "# Prototype 02 — Directed Transformation Map\n\nDRAFT · 24 forms · 72 links · 1/3 chance per outcome\nCyan = fantasy; green = animals.\n\nEight alternating stages, read left to right across the top row,\nthen left to right across the bottom row, then back to stage 1.\nEvery form points to all three forms of the next stage.\n\nNo direct reversals. Shortest return to any form: 8 casts.\nThis is a provisional long-cycle design, not a near-24-form tour.\n\nAllied casts add one temporary level; enemy casts keep earned levels.\nSee [[Prototype 02]] for healing, status, attack-reset and charge rules.\nCreature base stats are still TBD; open a card's source note to edit.\n\nEdges and note tables are manually kept consistent across the three maps."
    }
  ],
